OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers vote on 'leaving the UK'
OL,4,Aover migrant plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting is under way in a village's
OL,7,Fsymbolic referendum on "leaving the UK"
OL,9,FIt is taking place in Barnham, Suffolk,
OL,10,Fwhere many residents are angry at
OL,11,Fgovernment proposals to house asylum
OL,12,Fseekers at a former military base
OL,14,FThe Home Office, which insists it has
OL,15,Fbeen listening to villagers' concerns,
OL,16,Fsays about 930 men could be placed at
OL,17,FRAF Barnham
OL,19,FNews the base could become an asylum
OL,20,Fcentre triggered protests outside
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
