OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers vote on 'leaving the UK'
OL,4,Aover migrant plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnham is the second village to hold a
OL,7,Fvote on independence
OL,9,FIn September, people in Piddington, in
OL,10,FOxfordshire, voted to secede from the
OL,11,FUK after plans were announced to house
OL,12,Fasylum seekers nearby
OL,14,FThe result of Barnham's poll is
OL,15,Fexpected later today
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
